      <p purpose="platform-body">Fleet manages software across <a href="/apple">macOS</a>, <a href="/windows">Windows</a>, and <a href="/linux">Linux</a> from a single place. The same patch policies, the same catalog, the same automation, whether you're supporting a Mac-first team, a Windows shop, or a mixed environment with Linux.</p>
